    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients (Gels)",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Aqua, PVP, Phthalimidoperoxycaproic Acid, Glycerin, Xanthan Gum, Potassium Citrate, Mentha Piperita Oil, CI 77891, Mica, Cellulose Gum, Hydroxyapatite & Sodium Saccharin.<br\/><strong>Allergens:<\/strong> Limonene, Linalool.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Advanced PAP+ Teeth Whitening Kit consists of:<\/p><ul><li>1 × Instruction Manual<br\/><\/li><li>1 × Shade Guide<br\/><\/li><li>1 × Blue Light Whitening Accelerator<br\/><\/li><li>6 × 3ml Whitening Gels (up to 18 applications)<br\/><\/li><li>4 × Thermoforming Mouth Trays<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions + Tips",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>1. Mould: <\/strong>Boil water, let cool for 6–7 minutes. Submerge the tray for 3–4 seconds, place in your mouth, bite gently, and use suction to shape. Hold for 10–15 seconds, then cool in cold water. Repeat for lower tray.<\/p><p><strong>2. Trim: <\/strong>After moulding, trim off tabs and extra plastic with sharp scissors. Focus on edges near the gum line for a comfortable fit and to prevent irritation.<\/p><p><strong>3. Whiten: <\/strong>Brush and floss before use. Apply 0.5 ml gel to the top tray and 0.5 ml to the bottom tray (1 ml total). Each 3 ml syringe provides 3 full treatments. Insert trays and press lips for a snug fit.<\/p><p><strong>4. Activate: <\/strong>Switch on the LED light and attach it to the trays. Wear for 20–45 minutes—start with 20 mins and increase gradually as your teeth adjust. The light enhances whitening results.<\/p><p><strong>5. Clean: <\/strong>Rinse your mouth thoroughly and clean your toothbrush after use. Wash trays in lukewarm water, dry, and store in the case provided. Avoid hot water to prevent warping.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "792a2454-8dbe-40ac-ae87-a745eb01fb9b": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's are the key ingredients of the Teeth Whitening Kit?",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>Phthalimidoperoxycaproicacid (PAP) - An alternative to peroxide, PAP is clinically proven to whiten teeth without causing any sensitivity or irritation that ingredients such as peroxide can often cause<\/p><p>Hydroxyapatie - This ingredient works to rebuild the protective layer of your teeth, replacing minerals that may be lost from the tooth surface and strengthening teeth.<\/p><p>Potassium Citrate - Suitable for helping to relieve pre-existing teeth sensitivity, potassium citrate can provide protection against external aggressors that can cause discomfort<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "22779142-8db6-4dbf-93b6-ac3fd9d5b799": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warnings & Caution",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Not recommended for use if you have existing dental concerns such as tooth decay or gum sensitivity.<br\/><\/p><p>2. Not suitable for use on crowns, veneers, dentures, or other dental restorations.<br\/><\/p><p>3. Not intended for discolouration related to medical conditions or medications.<br\/><\/p><p>4. Not suitable for users with enamel defects or visible tooth damage.<br\/><\/p><p>5. Not recommended for children under 14 years of age.<br\/><\/p><p>6. Use once daily as directed. Do not exceed the recommended frequency.<br\/><\/p><p>7. Avoid swallowing the product during use.<br\/><\/p><p>8. Avoid contact with eyes and gums.<br\/><\/p><p>9. Do not use while pregnant or breastfeeding.<br\/><\/p><p>10. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a dental professional.<\/p><p>11. Discontinue use if irritation occurs.<\/p><p>12. Not suitable for use with crowns, veneers, or denture<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nbAPbH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Teeth Whitening Kit be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Teeth Whitening Kit is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. While the kit is designed to safely whiten your natural teeth, it also helps to remove surface stains on dental restorations. The formula is gentle on all dental materials, ensuring that your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings remain intact while your smile is brightened.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
